{"seq":1,"slug":"benchmark-and-evaluation","title":"基准测试与评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/evaluation-and-safety/benchmark-and-evaluation","wordCount":903,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"基准测试与评估\">基准测试与评估</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>评估的概念体系回答「用什么尺子、量什么、谁来判」，核心如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基准测试（Benchmark）</strong>：标准化的题目集与评分口径，用于在模型之间做可比对的横向对比。</li>\n<li><strong>评估指标</strong>：准确率（选择题）、pass@k（代码生成）、BLEU/ROUGE（翻译与摘要）、F1（抽取式 QA），指标必须与任务形态匹配。</li>\n<li><strong>LLM-as-Judge</strong>：用强模型作为评判者给输出打分，效率高但存在偏爱长回答、偏好同风格输出的固有偏见。</li>\n<li><strong>自定义评估</strong>：贴合业务场景的用例集，可检查关键词包含、格式函数与精确匹配，覆盖边界情况。</li>\n<li><strong>区分度</strong>：基准会随模型进步而「饱和」（如 MMLU、HumanEval 已被头部模型打满），选基准前需确认它对目标模型仍有区分力。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一条主线是**「评估是模型的尺子，尺子本身也会失效」**：自动化基准、LLM-as-Judge 与人工评估需要组合使用，并对饱和的基准保持警惕。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么评估很重要\">为什么评估很重要</h2><p>评估是 LLM 开发中不可或缺的环节。没有可靠的评估，就无法判断模型改进的效果、比较不同方案的优劣，也无法确保模型在生产环境中的可靠性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    M[&quot;模型&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;评估&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; B[&quot;基准测试&lt;br/&gt;标准化对比&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; C[&quot;自定义评估&lt;br/&gt;业务场景&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;人工评估&lt;br/&gt;质量把控&quot;]&#10;    B &amp; C &amp; H --&gt; D[&quot;改进方向&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    M[\"模型\"] --&gt; E[\"评估\"]\n    E --&gt; B[\"基准测试&lt;br/&gt;标准化对比\"]\n    E --&gt; C[\"自定义评估&lt;br/&gt;业务场景\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"人工评估&lt;br/&gt;质量把控\"]\n    B &amp; C &amp; H --&gt; D[\"改进方向\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"主流基准测试\">主流基准测试</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基准</th>\n<th>评估能力</th>\n<th>题目数</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>代表性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MMLU</td>\n<td>多学科知识</td>\n<td>14,042</td>\n<td>选择题</td>\n<td>综合知识水平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HumanEval</td>\n<td>代码生成</td>\n<td>164</td>\n<td>函数补全</td>\n<td>编程能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MT-Bench</td>\n<td>对话质量</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>多轮对话</td>\n<td>指令遵循</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GSM8K</td>\n<td>数学推理</td>\n<td>8,500</td>\n<td>应用题</td>\n<td>逻辑推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TruthfulQA</td>\n<td>真实性</td>\n<td>817</td>\n<td>问答</td>\n<td>幻觉程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HellaSwag</td>\n<td>常识推理</td>\n<td>10,042</td>\n<td>句子补全</td>\n<td>常识理解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MBPP</td>\n<td>代码生成</td>\n<td>974</td>\n<td>程序题</td>\n<td>基础编程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARC</td>\n<td>科学推理</td>\n<td>7,787</td>\n<td>选择题</td>\n<td>科学知识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPQA Diamond</td>\n<td>研究生级科学问答</td>\n<td>198</td>\n<td>选择题</td>\n<td>前沿科学推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SWE-bench Verified</td>\n<td>真实仓库修 issue</td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>代码补丁</td>\n<td>工程能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示（2026 年的基准现状）：</strong> 上半张表多为 2019–2023 年的经典基准；随着推理模型普及，MMLU/HumanEval 已被头部模型「打满」（接近或超过 90%），前沿评估重心转向 GPQA Diamond、SWE-bench Verified、AIME 数学竞赛等更难的基准，以及 LLM-as-Judge 与真实任务评测。选基准时先确认它对目标模型仍有区分度。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"benchmarks = {&#10;    &quot;MMLU&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;57 个学科的多选题&quot;,&#10;        &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;准确率&quot;,&#10;        &quot;example&quot;: &quot;以下哪个是 Python 中的不可变数据类型？ A.list B.dict C.tuple D.set&quot;,&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;HumanEval&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;函数级代码生成&quot;,&#10;        &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;pass@k&quot;,&#10;        &quot;example&quot;: &quot;def has_close_elements(numbers, threshold): ...&quot;,&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;MT-Bench&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;多轮对话评估&quot;,&#10;        &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;LLM 评分 (1-10)&quot;,&#10;        &quot;example&quot;: &quot;写一首关于大语言模型的诗 → 把它改写成 rap 风格&quot;,&#10;    },&#10;}&#10;&#10;for name, info in benchmarks.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;📊 {name}&quot;)&#10;    print(f&quot;  说明: {info[&#39;description&#39;]}&quot;)&#10;    print(f&quot;  指标: {info[&#39;metric&#39;]}&quot;)&#10;    print(f&quot;  示例: {info[&#39;example&#39;][:50]}...\\n&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">benchmarks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"MMLU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"57 个学科的多选题\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"准确率\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"example\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"以下哪个是 Python 中的不可变数据类型？ A.list B.dict C.tuple D.set\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"HumanEval\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"函数级代码生成\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pass@k\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"example\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"def has_close_elements(numbers, threshold): ...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"MT-Bench\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"多轮对话评估\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LLM 评分 (1-10)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"example\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"写一首关于大语言模型的诗 → 把它改写成 rap 风格\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name, info </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> benchmarks.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"📊 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  说明: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'description'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  指标: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'metric'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  示例: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'example'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"评估指标\">评估指标</h2><h3 id=\"自动评估指标\">自动评估指标</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def pass_at_k(n, c, k):&#10;    if n - c &lt; k:&#10;        return 1.0&#10;    return 1.0 - np.prod(1.0 - k / np.arange(n - c + 1, n + 1))&#10;&#10;for k in [1, 5, 10]:&#10;    score = pass_at_k(n=20, c=5, k=k)&#10;    print(f&quot;pass@{k} (20 次采样, 5 次通过): {score:.4f}&quot;)&#10;&#10;def accuracy(predictions, labels):&#10;    correct = sum(p == l for p, l in zip(predictions, labels))&#10;    return correct / len(labels)&#10;&#10;preds = [&quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;C&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;]&#10;labels = [&quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;]&#10;print(f&quot;\\n准确率: {accuracy(preds, labels):.2f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pass_at_k</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n, c, k):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.prod(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.arange(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pass_at_k(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#